{"id":"cad15e7b31ad3190","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-pi-11.md","title":"$\\Pi^1 1$","display":"df-pi-11 — $\\Pi^1_1$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pi-11","aliases":["58-df-pi-11"],"display":"df-pi-11 — $\\Pi^1_1$","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-analytical.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pi-11"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pi-11</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi-11 — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa999025216c4c01\" href=\"?note=fa999025216c4c01\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-analytical.md\">../batch09/58-df-analytical.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Analytic}_S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Analytic}_S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fa999025216c4c01\" href=\"?note=fa999025216c4c01\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-analytical.md\">../batch09/58-df-analytical.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi\\text{-}11\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathbb R\\setminus A\\in\\mathrm{Analytic}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi\\text{-}11\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathbb R\\setminus A\\in\\mathrm{Analytic}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi\\text{-}11}\\vdash\n\\Pi^1_1\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_S(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi\\text{-}11}\\vdash\n\\Pi^1_1\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_S(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span> is the coanalytic pointclass, the complements of the analytic (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span>) sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-analytical.md","status":"resolved","id":"fa999025216c4c01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-analytical.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-analytical.md","status":"resolved","id":"fa999025216c4c01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Analytic}_S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)$ (from [[../batch09/58-df-analytical.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{A